MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- 화면에 붙기 removed (behaviour, list entry, picture slot, glass effect). Pictures already
  saved for it are kept in the pet's data, just not shown.
- Poses no longer stay squashed (sitting, dozing, 도리도리, leaning, gift). Short bounces
  (landing, bump, "!", crouch) all follow 말랑 정도; 0 means no squish at all.
- Leaning into a pat: 12° → 6°.
- Held: no shiver, no 💦.
- Phone typing box closed: the window keeps its size until the keyboard is down
  (at most 1 s), instead of shrinking to half for a moment.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
